## The measurement, re-derived rather than trusted

The task file's numbers came from a top-level-only walk. I re-derived with a recursive src/ walk (94 files, src/format/ included — pinned by the_scan_covers_nested_src_modules): 302 backticked tokens → 134 Rust-shaped mentions → 81 unique candidates → the same 10 absent. The plan's number survived the walk that could have falsified it.

The 10 are excluded by six categories, not ten "known" entries: yoagent API (3), git sha (2), sabotage marker word (2 — assembled with concat! so tests/neutered_guards.rs doesn't flag my own register), const in tests/ (1), JSON wire field (1), clippy lint name (1). An unknown category is fatal, so the register can't fragment into eight spellings of one justification.

