One atomic mutate→run→restore, serially, sabotage marked NEUTERED: renaming collision_guard_skipped_message in src/agent_builder.rs (chosen after verifying its CLAUDE.md mention was live) reddened exactly one test — the new gate — by name, naming CLAUDE.md:90, with 14 passed, 1 failed and no pre-existing test moving. That width is the claim: the guard is genuinely new, not a restatement. Restore returned green with a byte-empty `git diff` on src/.

