## What it does not do, stated plainly

It is a text scan, not a parser (an occurrence in a comment counts); matching is by name, never resolved path (the tests/orphan_modules.rs limit); presence is all it proves — a sentence can name a live symbol and still be wrong; and it fixes nothing. If a real stale name surfaces, the census is the finding and fixing the prose is a follow-up task.
